      "id": "claim_03e9a4193a4542d9915fecbe01f6f743",
      "statement": "The API supports label creation, detail reads with an includeReleases flag, rename (with 503 when Spotify cannot verify the link audit), deletion, artist linking and unlinking, Spotify artist search via GET /api/search?type=artist, Spotify label search via GET /api/labels/search, and a dual-mode release listing for a label: GET /api/labels/{labelId}/releases returns the full list without query params and a paged LabelReleasesResponse with page/pageSize (400 on non-positive values, 404 for an unknown label).",
