      "id": "claim_26e1e840f8da4e268e02180afd1b28b5",
      "statement": "Renaming a label runs ReleasePoller.AuditLabelLinksAsync inside the same transaction: exact matches are re-upserted, verified mismatches and Spotify-404 albums are unlinked, and any link Spotify cannot verify throws LabelLinkAuditIncompleteException, which rolls the whole rename back (the label keeps its old name and all links) and surfaces as 503 Service Unavailable from PUT /api/labels/{id}.",
